  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="15">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 15</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="15" corresp="#wit-g">Elles oðre freolsa ⁊ fæstena healde man georne, swa swa þa heoldan þa ðe betst heoldan.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="15" corresp="#wit-g2">Elles oðre freolsa ⁊ fæstena healde man georne, swa swa þa heoldan þa þe betst heoldan.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="15" corresp="#wit-d">Elles oðre freolsa ⁊ fæstena healde man georne, swa swa þe heoldon þa ðe betst heoldon.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-d">Otherwise, festivals and fasts shall be strictly observed in accordance with the highest standards of the past.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Andere Feste und Fasten sonst halte man willig, so wie jene, welche [sie] bestens hielten, gehalten haben.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">Let other feasts and fasts otherwise be eagerly kept, as those kept them who kept them best.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
